      Languages:
      - Ronchli
      - Ronchli
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/045312/045312_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - These souls were once exemplary academics chosen to descend in the madness
        of Constellations. Upon discovery of the Truth, they rejected it and sought
        ignorance. Such attachment to the self is in need of purging. The humanity
        they held onto is now lost in aimless roaming.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/045312/045312_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/045312/045312_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The only thing these ectoplasms are good for is scaring visitors away with
        all its brooding.
      - "Der einzige Zweck dieser Ektoplasmen besteht darin, Besucher mit all ihrem
        Gr\xFCbeln abzuschrecken."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/045312/045312_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033798/033798_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - M-ALE
      - "M\xE4nnlich"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033798/033798_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Birthed from imagination, brought to life by science. Energy overflowed from
        their artificial bodies, granting these homunculi the power to defy the rules
        of the world itself. In exchange for their pseudo-humanity, they are able
        to manipulate matter and energy as we know it
      - "Aus der Fantasie geboren, durch die Wissenschaft zum Leben erweckt. Energie
        floss aus ihren k\xFCnstlichen K\xF6rpern und verlieh diesen Homunkuli die
        Macht, sich den Regeln der Welt selbst zu widersetzen. Im Austausch f\xFCr
        ihre Pseudo-Menschlichkeit sind sie in der Lage, Materie und Energie, wie
        wir sie kennen, zu manipulieren"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033798/033798_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - (Matter-Altering Living Experiment)
      - "(Materiever\xE4nderndes Lebendes Experiment)"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033798/033798_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Don't move! Can't you see that the light's still red? We need to follow what
        the walking traffic light says!
      - "Nicht bewegen! Kannst du nicht sehen, dass die Ampel immer noch rot ist?
        Wir m\xFCssen den Anweisungen der Fu\xDFg\xE4ngerampel folgen!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033798/033798_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033786/033786_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'FE:M-ALE '
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033786/033786_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - At the testing of human anatomy for such homunculi, it was born. The creation
        was brought to life by electrical energy and a unique genetic code. With
        the ability to harness electricity from within, every shock is a testament
        to its innate desire - to become what it is not.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033786/033786_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - (Fueled Electricity:Matter-Altering Living Experiment)
      - "(Betriebene Elektrizit\xE4t: Materie Ver\xE4nderndes Lebensexperiment)"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033786/033786_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Don't let that portable charging station shock you to an existential crisis
        about your origin. You get me?
      - "Lassen Sie sich von dieser tragbaren Ladestation nicht in eine existenzielle
        Krise Ihrer Herkunft st\xFCrzen. Verstehst du mich?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033786/033786_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/008238/008238_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Ignavitus
      - Der Ignavitus
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/008238/008238_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Fallen adventurers that met their demise at the Favor for The Undying. Deep-seated
        lust for the thrill of their last moments is inside each. This led them to
        sneak into the training barracks of undead gladiators. Alas, seeking the
        bloodiest weapon and shield to take their place.
      - "Gefallene Abenteurer, die bei \u201EFavour for The Undying\u201C ihr Ende
        fanden. In jedem steckt eine tief verwurzelte Lust auf den Nervenkitzel der
        letzten Momente. Dies f\xFChrte dazu, dass sie sich in die Trainingsbaracken
        untoter Gladiatoren schlichen. Leider sind sie auf der Suche nach der blutigsten
        Waffe und dem blutigsten Schild, um ihren Platz einzunehmen."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/008238/008238_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/008238/008238_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A cowardly brat playing with toys. Hey, be a dear and strike it down mid-tantrum
        so I can laugh at its face.
      - "Eine feige G\xF6re, die mit Spielzeug spielt. Hey, sei ein Schatz und schlag
        es mitten im Wutanfall nieder, damit ich \xFCber sein Gesicht lachen kann."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/008238/008238_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033852/033852_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - BLASTLING
      - Sprengen
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033852/033852_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A demonic rat experimented on with N-RGV. These beasts were initially used
        by alchemists for their scientific pursuit of weapons. Treated as failed
        experiments, they now infest the corners of the prison.
      - "Eine d\xE4monische Ratte experimentierte mit N-RGV. Diese Bestien wurden
        urspr\xFCnglich von Alchemisten f\xFCr ihre wissenschaftliche Suche nach
        Waffen eingesetzt. Als gescheiterte Experimente behandelt, befallen sie nun
        die Ecken des Gef\xE4ngnisses."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033852/033852_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Infected Rotling
      - Infizierter Rotling
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033852/033852_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Rotlings with an explosive personality.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033852/033852_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002730/002730_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - FURIOSO
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002730/002730_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Apathy is enough violence by itself. Before their transmutation, each prison
        guard faced only ahead. Thus, fell ignorant and callous to the cries of those
        they guard. These infernos pledged allegiance to Mother in exchange for a
        burgeoning. Both in distance and feeling.
      - "Apathie ist an sich schon genug Gewalt. Vor ihrer Umwandlung blickte jeder
        Gef\xE4ngnisw\xE4rter nur nach vorne. So blieben sie unwissend und gleichg\xFCltig
        gegen\xFCber den Schreien derer, die sie besch\xFCtzen. Diese Infernos schworen
        der Mutter Treue im Austausch f\xFCr einen Aufschwung. Sowohl in der Distanz
        als auch im Gef\xFChl."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002730/002730_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002730/002730_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You're telling me that they bowed down to a living monster prison so they
        can avoid more creatures? Respect.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002730/002730_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/050420/050420_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Scrie
      - Schrei
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/050420/050420_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Hear ye, hear ye! Fragments of crowds and podiums engulf the crevices of
        their minds. These roots scream as if drunk on the ardor of influence. Each
        seeks to overpower enemies using the tenacity of their voice.
      - "H\xF6rt, h\xF6rt! Fragmente von Menschenmengen und Podien verschlingen die
        Spalten ihres Geistes. Diese Wurzeln schreien, als seien sie betrunken von
        der Leidenschaft des Einflusses. Jeder versucht, seine Feinde mit der Beharrlichkeit
        seiner Stimme zu \xFCberw\xE4ltigen."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/050420/050420_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/050420/050420_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Nothing\u2019s more demeaning than a bunch of roots screaming at your ankles
        'n thinking they're better than you."
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/050420/050420_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/051136/051136_Name
