    - Term: Bestiary/001994/001994_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - These fungi arise from soil with twice the poison in its roots. They chase
        after its prey like a rabid beast - eager to tear off what disturbed its
        peace. Yet, the spores condensed in their anatomy are a fragile thing. A
        single trigger sets them off with an explosive pop.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001994/001994_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001994/001994_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Wouldn't want to be the brute that got reincarnated into a monstrous shroom.
      - "Ich m\xF6chte nicht der Rohling sein, der in einen monstr\xF6sen Pilz wiedergeboren
        wurde."
      Flags: 0000
