      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/073358/073358_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A matured mutation of Bulb'om. These fungi have mastered the art of controlling
        innate spores. At will, its body allows itself to fold into forms that fit
        its objective. Its demise lies in the constant movement of spores - aggravating
        its explosive power with each hit made.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/073358/073358_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/073358/073358_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "These fungi could practically render balloons useless, can\u2019t they?"
