    - Term: Bestiary/057434/057434_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The metamorphosis state of Ven'lly. Emerging with more limbs from its previous
        cocoon, these fungi roam on land. Its tentacles swing forward with the intent
        to clear its path. Illuminating within the poison fumes, they seek a way
        out of the mist they're in.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
