    - Term: Bestiary/057842/057842_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Horses that live to serve the demons of the underworld, they are summoned
        from the abyss and can only serve one master at a time. The stronger their
        lord is, the brighter their manes burn.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
