      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033840/033840_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A demonic rat that feeds on rotten flesh. These beasts were once standard
        mice that ventured into the Realm of The Dead. Having fallen into the blood
        lake, they emerged mangled yet alive.
      - "Eine d\xE4monische Ratte, die sich von verfaultem Fleisch ern\xE4hrt. Diese
        Bestien waren einst normale M\xE4use, die sich in das Reich der Toten wagten.
        Nachdem sie in den Blutsee gefallen waren, kamen sie verst\xFCmmelt, aber
        lebendig wieder heraus."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033840/033840_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Rotling
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033840/033840_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Time to ditch your warfarin, folks. Not even Death can annihilate these pesky
        rodents.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033840/033840_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
