    - Term: Bestiary/033804/033804_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - VIDITO
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033804/033804_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Lust and greed go hand in hand. Prison wardens addicted to the high that
        their power gave, seeking for more. Every grasp and pound is made to search
        for a resemblance.  These infernos submitted to Mother in exchange for a
        blazing buff to their old being.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033804/033804_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Fire Golem
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033804/033804_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Aww. Big guy just wants a hug. It wouldn't burn to give one, you know.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033804/033804_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
