    - Term: Bestiary/033888/033888_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - IMBROLLO
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033888/033888_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Whatever Mother beckons to do serves as a puppeteer to these beasts. Resting
        under skins of hound dogs, they strike differently to their appearance. These
        infernos loyally submit to the master that towers above them.
      - "Was auch immer Mutter zu tun winkt, dient diesen Tieren als Puppenspielerin.
        Sie ruhen unter den Fellen von Jagdhunden und unterscheiden sich durch ihr
        Aussehen. Diese Infernos unterwerfen sich treu dem Meister, der \xFCber ihnen
        thront."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033888/033888_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Scorchling
      - Sengend
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033888/033888_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I wonder if they just roll with whatever this tooth shack babbles on about.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
