      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004714/004714_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Grudges into giants. The glow emanating from these skeletal beings' chests
        set them apart.  Indignation of souls within the realm fuels each fiery spark.
        With no outlet of its own, they are channeled into the arrows. Each release
        grants the bones a brief soothing from the flames.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004714/004714_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004714/004714_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Just your basic veri with a built-in bunsen burner. Fancy-schmancy name as
        if it's a new skeletal being...
      - "Nur Ihre Grundausstattung mit integriertem Bunsenbrenner. Ausgefallener
        Name, als w\xE4re es ein neues Skelettwesen ..."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004714/004714_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004532/004532_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Skur\u2019lir"
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004532/004532_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Fallen adventurers that succumbed to the Spor'Aos. In a pseudo-mutation fashion,
        corruption that is deep-seated in soil coated itself around the perished.
        This granted the bones movement once more. Aiming toward enemies, they shoot
        with the purpose of spreading its poison.
      - "Gefallene Abenteurer, die den Spor'Aos erlegen sind. In einer Pseudomutationsart
        \xFCberzog sich tief im Boden verwurzelte Korruption um die Verstorbenen.
        Dies erm\xF6glichte den Knochen wieder Bewegung. Sie zielen auf Feinde und
        schie\xDFen mit der Absicht, ihr Gift zu verbreiten."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004532/004532_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004532/004532_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I'd ask them how the poison jelly tastes but I just remembered they couldn't
        stomach anything.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004532/004532_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004876/004876_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Venundi
      - Die Venundi
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004876/004876_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Hope is as rare as it can be in the city.  However, small sparks from the
        despondencies of souls manifest within these beings. These bones swore to
        dig their way through whatever's in their path. Each hack is made with no
        direction of where life truly is.
      - "Hoffnung ist in der Stadt so selten wie nur m\xF6glich.  Allerdings manifestieren
        sich in diesen Wesen kleine Funken aus der Verzweiflung der Seelen. Diese
        Knochen haben geschworen, sich ihren Weg durch alles zu bahnen, was ihnen
        in den Weg kommt. Jeder Hack wird ohne Orientierung dar\xFCber gemacht, wo
        das Leben wirklich ist."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004876/004876_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004876/004876_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A shame that their grind is being used to dig up crystals for big-wigs. What
        else can I say? Ah, capitalism.
      - "Schade, dass ihr Mahl dazu verwendet wird, Kristalle f\xFCr gro\xDFe Per\xFCcken
        auszugraben. Was kann ich sonst noch sagen? Ach, Kapitalismus."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/004876/004876_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/065014/065014_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Yearon
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/065014/065014_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Champions of rock and stone, these specters are the manifestation of the
        earth's will. Blessed by the land, they wield the power of the mountains,
        crushing their enemies under the weight of the world.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/065014/065014_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/065014/065014_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "So that's why they look like malnourished floating sticks, they literally
        eat dirt.\r"
      - "Deshalb sehen sie aus wie unterern\xE4hrte schwimmende St\xF6cke, sie fressen
        buchst\xE4blich Schmutz.\r"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
