      - The Justiciar
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/010842/010842_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Carnage calls to the deceitful. A totem for the betrayed, fury of the mistreated,
        they pierce through the cowardly - for vengeance and justice are two sides
        of the same coin.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/010842/010842_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
