      - Voracur
      - Voracur
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/069970/069970_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Victims of an excavation gone awry. Human miners that succumbed to the forest's
        curse, they left most of their humanity behind as their bestial instincts
        took over. They now hide within the caves they once exploited, in fear of
        the Protegor that guard the forest floor.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/069970/069970_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/069970/069970_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - This is the pinnacle of human evolution? Never in my existence did I feel
        as lucky to be a folio as I do now.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/069970/069970_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
