      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001810/001810_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Once a symbol of kindness, now corrupted with notions of pride and hostility.
        The spear of justice now rests in the hands of an unjust spirit. Felein ascended
        with the Lich King into the statues it \rfinds solace in. With a screech,
        it looks to pierce through uncorrupt souls.\r"
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
