    - Term: Bestiary/003240/003240_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Be it darkness, light. May it be under the scorching sun, or trapped in unrelenting
        winter, The One sees it all. Agents of the incomprehensible, they guard the
        temple, patiently waiting in the shadows. For their prey could never seem
        to resist the call of their bloodweb.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
