    - Term: Bestiary/003250/003250_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Glaciers, icicles, the chilling breath of life, forming bulbs of glacial
        vigor. Freezing but not frozen. Neither alive nor dead, they roam the grounds
        as the image of winter's gentle caress - or its bitter embrace.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
