      - Black Death
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/009178/009178_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Black Death is the Realm of the Dead's sole overlord. The many boasts
        of the throne - soul-embedded walls, razor-sharp blades, and his infamous
        undead army - all attest to his greatness. However, not a soul knows how
        time was before this ruler inhabited the castle.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/009178/009178_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/009178/009178_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Now, here's a villain when I see one! Mind tapping out for a chance to sit
        on your beloved throne, BD?
      - "Nun, hier ist ein B\xF6sewicht, wenn ich einen sehe! Hast du Lust, nach
        einer Chance zu suchen, auf deinem geliebten Thron zu sitzen, BD?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/009178/009178_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
