      Languages:
      - PLAGUELING
      - Plagend
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033876/033876_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Rodents injected with a substance intended as a cure, now turned into a flesh
        eating virus. Although some escaped the lab, spreading the disease to nearby
        towns, most of these pests went further into the caves when the laboratory
        was shut down.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033876/033876_Title
      TermType: 0
