    - Term: Bestiary/002008/002008_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Spor\u2019aos"
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002008/002008_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Corruption at its purest, they move as though it were a living being. Made
        of poison so potent that it\u2019s capable of killing a hundred humans with
        one drop. However, they don't remain in this form for long as they slowly
        seep into the soil, infecting everything around it. "
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002008/002008_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002008/002008_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Funny how the source of all corruption is a hopping scoop of ice cream.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
