      - "Vera\xF1a"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003120/003120_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Not all excavators that embraced their fate under the Pus find success in
        it. Those who failed to evolve despite their willingness are bestowed with
        arachnoid features. They crawl the premises to ensnare and feast on powerful
        intruders. Hoping - of evolving further.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003120/003120_Title
      TermType: 0
