    - Term: Bestiary/021266/021266_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Proud scholars who were deemed worthy of the gods' blessing, granting them
        the power to decipher the language written in the stars - leaving their humanity
        behind. As the original transcribers of the Records, they utilize these heavenly
        tomes to their full potential.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/021266/021266_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
