    - Term: Bestiary/033864/033864_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'An ambitious venture, an impossible feat, but as everything neared perfection,
        it was abandoned. Alone, it sat - waiting. Always waiting. As electricity
        fueled its artificial vessel, flowing through its veins, it came alive. A
        human, a monster, a mistake, was born. '
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/033864/033864_Title
      TermType: 0
