    - Term: Bestiary/033864/033864_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - He is definitely the middle child in his family. That's for sure.
      - Er ist definitiv das mittlere Kind in seiner Familie. Das ist sicher.
      Flags: 0000
