      - Proud henchmen of the Royal Death Guard, they guard the castle with unwavering
        loyalty. Armed with mighty shields, they defend the halls, denying entrance
        to those who do not belong. Their bodies strung together by magic, leaving
        them with but only one purpose, to protect.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002920/002920_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002920/002920_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - They have shields but not a full set of armor. Well, I guess we know where
        Death's entire budget went to.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002920/002920_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
