    - Term: Bestiary/011576/011576_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Inquitus
      - Der Inquitus
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/011576/011576_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Unvarnished desires do not perish with its host. Once dry bones of fallen
        adventurers come alive through musings of souls. They carry the will of those
        flowing through them.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/011576/011576_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/011576/011576_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Eh, sore losers that die after a few strikes. A rotling would look like a
        god compared to these white sticks.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/011576/011576_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
