    - Term: Bestiary/007094/007094_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Miseri
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/007094/007094_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Hanging inversely, these bones are given weight by the burden of despondencies.
        Blood seeping through brick walls cement them in place. It also grants long
        and sharp blades.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/007094/007094_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/007094/007094_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Cut off their hands and you have a new bone-afide chandelier. Hah! You had
        to laugh at that one.
