    - Term: Bestiary/003278/003278_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Somber spirits, pitiful remains of what things used to be. Vanity and insignificance.
        Happiness and sadness. Every fiber of their being, reduced to nothing but
        empty. They seek out lost travelers, impaling them - desperate to have what
        they have, to ultimately be something. \r"
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003278/003278_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
