      Languages:
      - "Thark\u2019n"
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001914/001914_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A roaming bird whose wings had been cut after a single exhale. The gas exuded
        by poison shrooms infested in the lungs of these avians. Sticking to each
        area, the spores found a place to bloom cruelly while corrupting inside.
        It soon reveals its evolution with a piercing cry.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001914/001914_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001914/001914_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I've seen flightless birds but never one that acts like a prickly bunny.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
