      Languages:
      - "Lychr\u2019n"
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001924/001924_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - From within the foliage, the rotten arise. Once towering trees, now reduced
        to a pile of decomposing waste. As the corruption flows through their mutated
        bodies, they chase down intruders, impaling them with their sharp thorns.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001924/001924_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/001924/001924_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Why are you running away from it?! It's basically a pile of rotten sticks!
      - 
      Flags: 0000
