    - Term: Bestiary/078972/078972_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Sivari
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/078972/078972_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Obstinate gladiators that refuse to accept their defeat. At their release,
        these bleeding warriors roam the area before finding themselves back at the
        coliseum. They thus gain the opposite of an honorable death - cut down for
        the purpose of serving as practice targets.
      - "Hartn\xE4ckige Gladiatoren, die sich weigern, ihre Niederlage hinzunehmen.
        Nach ihrer Freilassung durchstreifen diese blutenden Krieger die Gegend,
        bevor sie sich wieder im Kolosseum wiederfinden. Damit erlangen sie das Gegenteil
        eines ehrenvollen Todes \u2013 sie werden abgeholzt, um als \xDCbungsziele
        zu dienen."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/078972/078972_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/078972/078972_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Disintegrating sounds a lot better than parading my dead body after a defeat.
        Double the humiliation.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/078972/078972_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003148/003148_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Talimbabaga
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003148/003148_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Skittering, crawling, relishing in the sound of cracking as they dig their
        claws into oh so sweet flesh - growing into an amalgamation of meat and bones.
        Born from the inadequacies of mankind, they roam the temple halls in search
        of what they desire most - everything. '
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003148/003148_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Horrvus
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003148/003148_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I didn't know having skulls as backpacks are a thing now. I guess even insects
        can be trendsetters huh...
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003148/003148_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002878/002878_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Records of Krios
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002878/002878_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - With each flip of a page, the stars align, granting mere humans the chance
        to speak to the gods themselves. As the first flames forge the heavens, as
        the world is set ablaze, fire is both creation and destruction - and Krios
        shall rule them all.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002878/002878_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002878/002878_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Don't even dare compare me with those lowlives. I am a folio, and they are
        books. Huge difference.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002878/002878_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002892/002892_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Records of Skorpios
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002892/002892_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Knowledge transcribed from the frozen depths of the cosmos, forbidden understanding
        of beings beyond our comprehension. Skorpios epitomizes the numbness of humanity,
        the complete absence of warmth and compassion; and from within oneself, an
        unforgiving winter.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002892/002892_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002892/002892_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - An overblown nickname for what's basically a flying book stuck in the freezer
        for too long.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002892/002892_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002902/002902_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Records of Ydrukai
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002902/002902_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'One must be set apart to be set above. These records were written eons ago
        for the illumination of the new-born self. Each bolt struck is for the purpose
        of revealing Knowledge beyond the Cosmos: The Sovereign Truth follows after
        the destruction of ignorance in the mind.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002902/002902_Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002902/002902_Store Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Hah! I got a better title: "Ancient Tree Pulps Manipulate Idiots That Believe
        Everything They Read".'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/002902/002902_Hunter Notes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 0000
