    - Term: Bestiary/003176/003176_Name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Tulthar
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003176/003176_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Dying corpses brought back to life by the black blood, they arm themselves
        with the memories of their victims - displaying their remains for all the
        world to see. Skulls, bones, corpses, each a symbol of one's strength, an
        encapsulation of one's greatness.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bestiary/003176/003176_Title
      TermType: 0
